Frontend: AdminKit Core 3.5.0 (AdminKit Authors, MIT), Vue and their dependency
closure. AdminKit's precompiled JavaScript includes vendor code: its upstream
dist/js/app.js.LICENSE.txt is retained in full, alongside each production npm
package's LICENSE/COPYING/NOTICE. This includes Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC and MIT
