AdminKit CSS uses inline Bootstrap SVG controls; no remote fonts, images or
styles are fetched. Release starter images contain only their Vite entry's
reachable assets (no demo Vue/Chart.js/vector map JavaScript).

Run `node release/licenses.mjs frontend OUTPUT` after `npm ci` in frontend to
produce the complete frontend license inventory and original notices. Runtime
builds also collect licenses for their Go dependency graph, Go's standard
library, and the CA certificate bundle. Every release image contains
/app/LICENSE, /app/NOTICE and /app/licenses/; OCI bundles include an SPDX SBOM
and BuildKit provenance. See docs/guide/releases.md for verification and scope.
